    title: >-
      Does One Integer Still Price Work and Memory in Parallel? A Preregistered
      Experiment on Interaction Combinators
    authors:
      - given-names: Serhii
        family-names: Glova
        alias: s0fractal
    doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22073568"
    year: 2026
    notes: >-
      EXP-004. A separate record rather than a section of the paper: the paper
      proves a theorem about a sequential machine, and this measures a setting the
      paper does not claim. It reports that the work-and-memory bound transfers to
      confluent parallel reduction while Book I's per-redex partial-progress
      enforcement does not, so a parallel machine must choose the granularity of
      refusal explicitly. Preregistered before the reducer existed.
  - type: software
    title: "Warrant: signed, hash-addressed decision records for AI agents"
    authors:
      - given-names: Serhii
        family-names: Glova
        alias: s0fractal
    repository-code: "https://github.com/s0fractal/warrant"
    notes: >-
      Consumes Book I as the ski@v1 check runtime, and supplies the Warrant v0.3
      record format that Book III federation and GOV-anchors are profiles of.
